<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interim Services raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interim Services raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Interim Services Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Interim Services said Monday it reached a definitive agreement to sell its Interim HealthCare business to Cornerstone Equity Investors for $134 million. The net proceeds will be used to reduce debt, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Interim Services gained 1-3/4 to 43.</p>
</text>
